{"overview":"یک ارباب سامورایی اعضای پسر تازه متولد شده خود را در ازای تسلط در میدان جنگ به چهل و هشت شیطان مبادله می‌کند. با این حال، نوزاد رها شده به لطف یک پزشک که او را به اندام‌های مصنوعی بدوی مجهز کرده زنده می‌ماند - اندام‌های مصنوعی کشنده‌ای که پسر ستمدیده با آن‌ها برای شکار انبوه شیاطین استفاده می‌کند تا قبل از رویارویی با پدرش، بدنش را تکه تکه بازیابی کند. قهرمان جوان در سفرهای خود با یتیمی ‌روبرو می‌شود که ادعا می‌کند بزرگترین دزد ژاپن است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"During the Warring States period, the young thief Dororo encounters Hyakkimaru, a strange, sightless boy who wields fearsome prosthetics in place of his missing limbs. Parts of Hyakkimaru’s body were traded to a group of 12 demons by his father in exchange for power, but thanks to a kindly medicine man, Hyakkimaru survived his horrifying ordeal. Now he roams the land in search of his missing body, and together he and Dororo will fight to survive in an unforgiving, demon-plagued world.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2019,"poster":"/gPE9ftjpPCCBbvK7JW363kWn967.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":["اوسامو تزوکا"],"crew_en":["Osamu Tezuka"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"ریو سوزوکی","role":"Dororo (voice)","photo":"/sDY9AowcBmP1CKZB5NAaehiowc0.jpg","en":"Rio Suzuki"},{"name":"鈴木拡樹","role":"Hyakkimaru (voice)","photo":"/hmY8z9eNtE0it8nNmYaFjlGjR1a.jpg","en":"Hiroki Suzuki"},{"name":"内田直哉","role":"Daigo Kagemitsu (voice)","photo":"/i1Vl4QbiEsyATmX2HSH2rIEyzeS.jpg","en":"Naoya Uchida"},{"name":"大塚明夫","role":"Jukai (voice)","photo":"/uH9oiqOOgrsz2zNnouVZ1qPzDyb.jpg","en":"Akio Otsuka"},{"name":"千葉翔也","role":"Tahoumaru (voice)","photo":"/pF2urY77wuCYd9Fxh7dTirFYKSF.jpg","en":"Shoya Chiba"},{"name":"佐々木睦","role":"Biwamaru (voice)","photo":"/vfWeOCWPMONdhcm4B35B0vVhgbj.jpg","en":"Mutsumi Sasaki"}],"trailer":"YgHPBwLu0BA","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83100/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","